    "All values come from Volvo Group official annual-report eleven-year tables; SEK million balance sheet/income rows and SEK billion cash flows are scaled to full SEK. Cash flows retain the published one-decimal-billion precision. The eleven-year tables state that each historical year follows the accounting standards then applicable and is not restated for later accounting changes.",
